# Machine-local Claude Code state only. The rest of .claude/ is deliberately
# tracked: three of this library's own skills tell users to COMMIT what they put
# there (.claude/onboard/topics.yaml, .claude/scars.md, .claude/learning/), and a
# blanket ignore would contradict our own instructions — see docs/adr/0001.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
